<?php $title='Reservas';require __DIR__.'/../layouts/header.php'; ?><div class="app-shell"><?php require __DIR__.'/../layouts/sidebar.php'; ?><main class="main"><header class="page-head"><div><div class="breadcrumb">GESTIÓN / <strong>Reservas</strong></div><h1>Reservas</h1><p>Registra solicitudes y controla el estado de cada viaje.</p></div></header><?php require __DIR__.'/../layouts/flash.php'; ?><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Nueva reserva</h2><p>El código de reserva se genera automáticamente.</p></div></div><form class="inline-form" method="post" action="index.php?page=reservation-save"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><select name="client_id" required><option value="">Seleccionar cliente *</option><?php foreach($clients as $c): ?><option value="<?=$c['id']?>"><?=e($c['name'])?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><select name="package_id" required><option value="">Seleccionar paquete *</option><?php foreach($packages as $p): ?><option value="<?=$p['id']?>"><?=e($p['name'])?> · <?=e($p['currency'])?> <?=number_format((float)$p['price'],2)?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><input type="date" name="travel_date" min="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required><input type="number" name="passengers" min="1" value="1" placeholder="Pasajeros" required><input type="number" name="total_amount" min="0.01" step="0.01" placeholder="Total en Bs *" required><select name="status"><option>Pendiente</option><option>Confirmada</option></select><input name="notes" placeholder="Notas de la reserva"><button class="btn primary">＋ Registrar reserva</button></form><div class="hint">Importante: el total se registra en bolivianos (Bs) para el control interno, aunque el paquete de origen esté expresado en otra moneda.</div></section><section class="panel section-gap"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Listado de reservas</h2><p>Historial operativo y pagos asociados.</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CÓDIGO</th><th>CLIENTE</th><th>PAQUETE</th><th>FECHA VIAJE</th><th>PAX</th><th>TOTAL</th><th>PAGADO</th><th>SALDO</th><th>ESTADO</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($reservations as $r): $balance=max(0,(float)$r['total_amount']-(float)$r['paid']); ?><tr><td><strong><?=e($r['code'])?></strong></td><td><?=e($r['client_name'])?></td><td><?=e($r['package_name'])?></td><td><?=e($r['travel_date'])?></td><td><?=e($r['passengers'])?></td><td><?=e(money($r['total_amount']))?></td><td><?=e(money($r['paid']))?></td><td><?=e(money($balance))?></td><td><span class="status <?=strtolower($r['status'])?>"><?=e($r['status'])?></span></td></tr><?php endforeach; if(!$reservations): ?><tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">Aún no hay reservas registradas.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div></section><footer class="page-footer">NETA Gestión Integral <span>Control de reservas</span></footer></main></div><?php require __DIR__.'/../layouts/footer.php'; ?>
